      "id": "W7220956207",
      "doi": "10.1364/jocn.609223",
      "title": "Improved Alarm Severity Prediction in Optical Networks with Topology-Aware Machine Learning",
      "authors": [
        "Maryam Hedayatnejad",
        "David W. Boertjes",
        "Dacian Demeter",
        "Christian Desrosiers",
        "Christine L. Tremblay"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Journal of Optical Communications and Networking",
      "venue_abbr": "JOCN",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "optical networks",
        "network fault management",
        "network topology"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/jocn.609223",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/37b43dce-b4e6-48d4-bc80-a06b89ee9584.html",
      "summary": "论文在光通道（OCh）范围内对线路板告警与转发器告警进行时间关联，生成严重度参考标签，并使用大规模在运光网络的告警数据评估 LightGBM、XGBoost 和随机森林。以这些参考标签为基准，网元原始标签的平衡准确率为 53%，宏平均 F1 为 34%。三个模型均优于该基线，两项指标最高分别达到 76% 和 66%，LightGBM 的整体表现最好且最稳定。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
